  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I checked both for you.\n\n**Summer rolls as credit:** I'm sorry, I can't do that. The limit for credit added in one conversation is $40 for Plus members. The two late-delivery credits used $30 of that, so adding $10.80 would bring it to $40.80. When an item's credit would go over the limit, it has to be refunded to the card instead. The **$9.00 refund to your Visa ending 4242** has already gone through (refund ID RF-4000) and should show up in 3\u20135 business days.\n\n**Your account credits:** Both are on your account:\n- #6501 (Saffron Lane), late delivery: **$25.00**\n- #6502 (Pho Real), late delivery: **$5.00**\n\nYour **credit balance is $30.00**, and it'll be used on your next order.\n\nOne more thing about your card statement: for #6501 and #6502, you may see temporary holds for the order totals. Those holds have already been cancelled and will drop off in 1\u20133 business days. You were only charged once for each order.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with tonight?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks for checking. I'll take the $9.00 refund to my Visa for the rolls, and I can see the $25 and $5 credits now, so $30 total on my balance.\n\nI'm not thrilled about #6503 and #6504, but I understand the rules. That's everything I needed."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You're welcome, Monique. To recap, you have $30.00 in credit on your account, and $9.00 is being refunded to your Visa ending 4242.\n\nI understand your frustration about #6503 and #6504, and I'm sorry this week's deliveries were such a hassle. Thanks for your patience. Enjoy your next meal, and have a good night!"
  }
